android/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# ── Not part of the program ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is PUBLIC. Anything not listed here is published the moment it is committed, so
# working material lives on disk only. What the app needs to build and run is in app/, tools/,
# desktop/, installer/, android/ and scripts/ - everything else is notes.

# Private notes and plans. Put new ones in notes/ and they are ignored automatically.
notes/
letterex-plan(scrabble).md
# The working documents - kept and updated on disk, not in the repository (owner, 2026-09-26: "they do not need to be
# in the repo"). README.md is the project's public description.
CHANGELOG.md
DESIGN.md
PLAN.md

# Design working material: the handoff pages the UI was built from, the conversation exports and
# the delivery archives. Kept on disk, not shipped - DESIGN.md still describes what they contained.
design/
*.dc.html
*.zip

